		},
		{"id":"687bd42a4ee8abfe","type":"file","file":"LLM/2-Source/7-Deep Learning/1-Pytorch/0-张量的基础操作.md","x":2407,"y":4005,"width":400,"height":400},
		{
			"id":"2ec86900e8dfd0a5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"按那个轴运算, 对应轴发生变化",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2597,
			"y":3840,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"1606c4852bc0a579",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"标量/底层\n`torch.scalar_tensor(val)`0 维标量",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2407,
			"y":3505,
			"width":260,
			"height":80,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"647a8acde6410d98",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"cat",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2277,
			"y":3597,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"80b9e2a0f6fa60d5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"不增加维度",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2677,
			"y":3597,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"0c1e510fb74b9617",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"stack",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2277,
			"y":3730,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"811ce8d89369bd98",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"增加维度",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2677,
			"y":3670,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"c976847ccb9e7910",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"dim等于几, 增加那个轴",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2677,
			"y":3757,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"a42c1b65dd550ded",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"按形状填充\n`torch.zeros(sz)` /`torch.ones(sz)`\n全 0 / 全 1\n\n`torch.full(sz, val)`\n全填指定值\n\n`torch.empty(sz)`\n未初始化，快但值是垃圾",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2407,
			"y":2905,
			"width":260,
			"height":120,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"cac0ef10c44e27ed",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"## 三个必记坑\n\n1. **`arange` 右开，`linspace` 右闭**  \n    `arange(0, 11)` → 0~10；`linspace(0, 10, 11)` → 也是 0~10，但含 10。\n    \n2. **`torch.tensor` 一定复制，`as_tensor` / `from_numpy` 共享内存**  \n    改共享的张量会改到原数据，要注意。\n    \n3. **`empty` 不是全 0，是全垃圾**  \n    别直接读，先 `fill_` / 赋值再用。\n## 懒人四件套\n\n日常 90% 场景就这四个：\ntorch.tensor([...])      # 已有数据\ntorch.zeros(2, 3)        # 占位/初始化\ntorch.randn(2, 3)        # 随机权重\ntorch.arange(11)         # 序列",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2724,
			"y":2905,
			"width":520,
			"height":500,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"2010069f380c2b06",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"随机\n\n`torch.rand(sz)\n`[0,1) 均匀\n`torch.randn(sz)`\n标准正态，初始化权重最常用\n\n`torch.randint(low, high, sz)`整数均匀，右开\n\n`torch.randperm(n)`\n0~n-1 随机排列",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2407,
			"y":3075,
			"width":260,
			"height":100,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"b2d0b1c5534fedfa",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"序列区间\n`torch.arange(start, end, step)`\n等差数列，**右开**\n\n`torch.linspace(start, end, steps)`\n等分，**右闭**，默认 float",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2407,
			"y":3235,
			"width":260,
			"height":90,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"232cc5c497797630",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"特殊矩阵\n`torch.eye(n)`\n单位矩阵\n`torch.diag(vec)`\n向量造对角阵",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2407,
			"y":3385,
			"width":260,
			"height":80,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"785c2e1dd756cd92",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"归约(统计)",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1947,
			"y":3820,
			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
