			"width":260,
			"height":60,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"4fd66d341ed836e8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"从数据创建\n\n`torch.tensor(data)`\n最常用，会复制数据\n\n`torch.as_tensor(data)\n尽量共享内存，不复制\n\n`torch.from_numpy(ndarray)`NumPy 转张量，共享内存",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2407,
			"y":2745,
			"width":260,
			"height":120,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"9cd126131a4442b9",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"多维数组,以类的形式封装起来\n类型:\n\t0维张量:标量, 一个单独的数\n\t1维张量: 数组[1,2,3]\n\t2维张量:二维数组,矩阵\n\t3维及以上,高阶张量",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":2207,
			"y":2217,
			"width":260,
			"height":220,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"3d69692d9227fb49",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"标量",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1797,
			"y":2227,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"eaeed88d2f35d499",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"向量",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1877,
